      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nREA Donohoe Spring present to the market this 2 Bedroom Cottage Style Bungalow on Compact C. 0.12 acre Site With Outbuildings. Convenient to Amenities. Requires Renovation Modernisation, Offering Excellent Potential. FOR SALE BY PRIVATE TREATY\n\n \n\nThis cottage style bungalow extends to 70 sqm / 753 sqft comprises; \n\nPorch\n\nEntrance Hall (3.8 x 1.2)\n\nSitting Room (3.7 x 3.3) with open fireplace\n\nKitchen (4.0 x 3.8) with Hot Press\n\nBedroom 1 (3.7 x 2.6),\n\nBedroom 2 (3.7 x 2.6)\n\nShower Room (1.9 x 1.8)\n\nRear Hall (1.9 x 1.8) with Stairs to Attic with Bonus Room/Optional 3rd Bedroom (3.8 x 3.2) with eaves storage.\n\n \n\nThe exterior finish is plaster with tile roof the double glazed window. The cottage has modern electric heaters and is serviced by electricity, mains water with septic tank (located in adjoining field with full wayleave ROW). Plumbed for Radiators. High speed fibre broadband is available. BER: G. \n\n \n\nThe property sits on a compact C. 0.12 acre site (Folio CN16463F) with off street parking to the side. A timber deck extends along the front and side of the cottage and will require repair or replacement. The rear garden is in need of cutting back overgrown trees but offers excellent potential to create private garden area. \n\n \n\nAdjoining the cottage on one side is a storage stage (1.7 x 3.5). There is also a large detached shed (3.0 x 7.0), ideal for storage or small workshop.\n\n \n\nRequiring some renovation modernisation throughout, this property would be ideal for first time buyers, those looking to move closer to amenities or as an excellent \"buy to let\" investment. \n\n \n\nLocated in a popular residential area, just off the N87 C. 1.5km to all amenities at Ballyconnell including Shops, restaurants, coffee shops, bars, schools and Shannon/Erne Blueway The Slieve Russell Hotel Golf Club. 30 minutes drive to both Cavan Town Enniskillen. Under 2 hour drive to Dublin and Belfast. GPS: 54.118348, -7.605149.\n\n \n\nViewing Highly Recommended by appointment only. \n\n"
      },
      {
